sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    C->>S: SYN (seq=x, cwnd=10 MSS)
    Note over S: SYN_RCVD<br/>half-open state
    S-->>C: SYN,ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)
    Note over C: Client sẵn sàng<br/>Gửi data hoặc ACK
    C->>S: ACK (seq=x+1, ack=y+1)
    Note over C,S: ESTABLISHED
    Note over C,S: Data transfer begins
    C->>S: FIN (active close)
    S-->>C: ACK
    S-->>C: FIN (passive close)
    C->>S: ACK
    Note over C: TIME_WAIT 60s<br/>(Linux default)
    Note over S: CLOSED
